marksight (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
    - User interface translated into 100 locales besides English.
    - Screen reader support: announced match counts, image alt text,
      correct heading levels.
    - Documents stream into the view instead of building before the
      first paint.
    - See CHANGELOG.md for the full list of user-facing changes.

 -- The marksight contributors <marksight@example.org>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000

